          "text": "OSebaniya, noJehoshafati, noNethaneli, no-Amasayi, noZakariya, noBenaya, no-Eliyezeri, abapristi, babetha amacilongo phambi komphongolo kaNkulunkulu; o-Obede Edomi noJehiya babengabamasango omphongolo.",
