          "text": "UDavide wayembethe ingubo yelineni elicolekileyo, nawo onke amaLevi ayethwala umphongolo, nabahlabeleli, noKenaniya induna yokuhlabelela kanye nabahlabeleli; UDavide wayembethe ingubo yasehlombe yelineni.",
